#ASSERT `s 524(4)(b) the judge or justice found under paragraph (3)(b) that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the accused has committed an indictable offence while being subject to the summons, appearance notice, undertaking or release order` TRUE `s 493.01 fixture hybrid` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(b) the judge or justice found under paragraph (3)(b) that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the accused has committed an indictable offence while being subject to the summons, appearance notice, undertaking or release order` TRUE `s 493.01 fixture hybrid elected` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(b) the judge or justice found under paragraph (3)(b) that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the accused has committed an indictable offence while being subject to the summons, appearance notice, undertaking or release order` TRUE `s 493.01 fixture summary` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(b) the judge or justice found under paragraph (3)(b) that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the accused has committed an indictable offence while being subject to the summons, appearance notice, undertaking or release order` FALSE `s 493.01 fixture indictable` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(c) any of the outstanding charges against the accused include charges for an offence referred to in subsection 515(6) or 522(2)` (LIST (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(c) any of the outstanding charges against the accused include charges for an offence referred to in subsection 515(6) or 522(2)` (LIST (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4)(c) any of the outstanding charges against the accused include charges for an offence referred to in subsection 515(6) or 522(2)` (LIST NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) the order. args: the judge or justice cancels; the answer of the circumstances; the accused shows cause by clearly demonstrating their release plan
#ASSERT `s 524(4) the judge or justice must order that the accused be detained in custody` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 524(4) the judge or justice must order that the accused be detained in custody` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4) the judge or justice must order that the accused be detained in custody` FALSE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 524(4) the judge or justice must order that the accused be detained in custody` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
