-- (7) judge in Quebec. args: the province; the order to detain was made by a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of Quebec; the office the person holds
-- (a) the order was made by a judge of the superior court of Quebec: the same meaning as paragraph (b) of the definition in s 493 (a judge of the superior court, or three judges of the Court of Quebec)
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec TRUE `s 525(7) a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec TRUE `s 525(7) three judges of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec TRUE `s 525(7) a judge of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec TRUE `s 525(7) an office that is none of those` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) any other case: a judge of the superior court, a judge of the Court of Quebec or three judges of the Court of Quebec
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec FALSE `s 525(7) a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec FALSE `s 525(7) a judge of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec FALSE `s 525(7) three judges of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Quebec FALSE `s 525(7) an office that is none of those` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- another province: the subsection is for the Province of Quebec, so the answer is not covered
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Ontario FALSE `s 525(7) a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 525(7) the person is a judge for the purposes of this section in the Province of Quebec` Alberta TRUE `s 525(7) a judge of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS NOTHING
-- paragraph (a): the order was made by a judge of the superior court of Quebec, so "judge" has the meaning of paragraph (b) of the definition in section 493: a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province or three judges of the Court of Quebec; one judge of the Court of Quebec is not within it.
#ASSERT `s 525(7)(a) the office as section 493 knows it` `s 525(7) a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province` EQUALS `s 493 a judge of the superior court of criminal jurisdiction of the province`
#ASSERT `s 525(7)(a) the office as section 493 knows it` `s 525(7) three judges of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS `s 493 three judges of the Court of Quebec`
#ASSERT `s 525(7)(a) the office as section 493 knows it` `s 525(7) a judge of the Court of Quebec` EQUALS `s 493 an office that is none of those`
#ASSERT `s 525(7)(a) the office as section 493 knows it` `s 525(7) an office that is none of those` EQUALS `s 493 an office that is none of those`

§ `Tests -- section 526: directions for expediting proceedings`
-- arg: the accused appears under this Part before the court, judge or justice
#ASSERT `s 526 the court, judge or justice may give directions for expediting any proceedings in respect of the accused` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 526 the court, judge or justice may give directions for expediting any proceedings in respect of the accused` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
